<title>TUNISIA: Tunisia's STAR insurance firm has higher '96 pft.</title>
<headline>Tunisia's STAR insurance firm has higher '96 pft.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Profits of leading insurance company Societe Tunisienne d'Assurances et de Reassurances STAR rose to 2.35 million dinars in 1996 from 1.5 million dinars in 1995, results showed on Wednesday.</p>
<p>State-controlled STAR is estimated to have a market share of over one third.</p>
<p>($=1.1062 dinar)</p>
<p>Tunis newsroom -- 2161-787538</p>
